{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有明显拼反。遗漏了不愿表达的深层顾虑：他担心一旦说出口，两人的关系可能发生变化，也不确定下次能否更加坦白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无明显拼反，但遗漏了放松背后的不安和失去支撑的感觉，包括怀疑幸福是否真实、能维持多久，以及熟悉的亲近突然产生隔阂。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无明显拼反，但遗漏了渴望中明显的身体性和情色暖意，不只是一般的幸福、悲伤和不舍，而是已经被强烈的身体冲动卷入，却仍不想退出。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无明显拼反，但遗漏了重新敞开心扉后带有玩心的调情与回应，亲近不只是坦然表达喜欢，也恢复了轻松活泼的互动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无明显拼反，但遗漏了安静下来之后仍有的一点积极猜想：他想到对方也许喜欢自己在身边，因此感到些许高兴。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无明显拼反，但遗漏了喜悦中仍然存在的索求和不满足：他近乎恳求地还想要更多，即使已经非常幸福，也无法完全满足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无明显拼反，但遗漏了保护这份亲近的具体原因：即使听到保证，他仍害怕刚得到的幸福消失；同时，他也在隐藏心意以避免受伤和真心想对对方好的念头之间挣扎。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把沉重缓和概括成放下和释然，程度略显彻底。原稿没有说他完全释怀，结尾还有经历剧烈内心震荡后的明确收束，以及最后沉重和弦带来的安定感。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线是同一段亲近关系中的幸福、渴望、紧张、不舍与重新接纳，但拼出的故事弱化了身体和情色张力、对失去的反复焦虑，以及结尾从温暖余韵走向明确沉静收束的意味，因而比完整稿显得更像一个泛化的情感成长故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f39c8b8-e760-4e01-adb9-7f9001cd9e86", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T090349926493Z", "elapsed_seconds": 264.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T09:08:14.156914+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "44b706a2beeefd13e0ddecd144273c76c822bb63f435abd29e6dca86bb1d776d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T090349926493Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bf54ff35cc35d8da6afcc1989fa141aa47324b0638fb037e88e8fe8b58fef5e0"}}}
